Scope

The MIT license above covers the original work in this repository: the
documentation (README.md, docs/, docs/pl/), tools/, logofix/, examples/ and
the boot logo scripts (bootlogo/*.py, tools/bootlogo/**/*.py), together with
the binaries built from them (e.g. logofix.bin).

It does NOT cover these files, which keep their own licenses:

- vmlinux.bin and modules/*.ko: the Linux kernel, GPL-2.0.
  Source: https://github.com/mztulip/linux_msd781x (branch mstar_v6_7_rebase)
- bin/fbdoom: fbDOOM / Chocolate Doom, GPL-2.0.
  Source: https://github.com/mztulip/fbDOOM
- rootfs_gcc.7z: a Buildroot root filesystem; every package in it has its
  own license (GPL, LGPL, MIT, BSD, ...). Sources: https://buildroot.org
- The Tux images (bootlogo/Tux.svg, the Tux parts of the boot logos and
  tools/bootlogo/**/tux*.png): Tux by Larry Ewing (lewing@isc.tamu.edu),
  made with The GIMP. They may be used and modified if he and The GIMP are
  credited.

MStar's DSP code and audio init data are not included. tools/board/
extract_audio_fw.py generates them from the user's own flash dump.
